<p>Module ironair.components.iron_electrode SHALL provide class IronElectrode.</p>
<p>The component SHALL dynamically model metallic iron, Fe(OH)2, Fe3O4, active surface
area, passivation thickness, porosity, electrode temperature, and irreversible
active-material loss.</p>
<p>The RHS SHALL calculate iron phase derivatives from the shared reaction network.</p>
